geforce-sriov: the owner of the framebuffer slots of Ada VFs.

These hunks only call into nvidia/gs-fb-owner.c, which the driver step copies into the tree together
with common/inc/gs-fb-owner.h. What the code does and why is in the comment at the top of that file.
Every hunk must match exactly once (gs_apply_source_patch); the line numbers are those of 580.159.01.

